  (descr "Cherry MX style mechanical keyboard switch, Kailh/Gateron hot-swap socket and through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R1.00 corner relief (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: ISO Enter flipped upside down (courtyard only; switch orientation unchanged). No stabilizer PCB features. Plate-mount MX stabilizers can be used.")
